Subject: [PATCH] phase 0: BLAS variants on one instance (--blas): the wheel's
 kernels, BLIS, gcc 14

launch.sh --blas "NAME ..." benchmarks each variant on the same instance (bench.sh, QAP_BLAS;
out/blas_NAME/), and the table gets a BLAS column. Tested locally: openblas, openblas-haswell,
netlib. Not tested: blis (cloned and built on the instance) and gcc14.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014vvMYV3r6FDoHTc2G3VVqC
